{"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/worldmodule\/world\/spawn(contentsof:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"@discardableResult","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"mutating","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"spawn","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"contentsOf","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"scene","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Scene","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Scene","preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule5SceneV"},{"text":") -> [","kind":"text"},{"text":"Entity","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Entity","preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule6EntityV"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Entity","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Entity","preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule6EntityV"},{"text":"]","kind":"text"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"]}]},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"name":"scene","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The scene whose entities to spawn.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"return-value","type":"heading","text":"Return Value"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The entity spawned for each live entity of the scene, keyed by the scene’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"entity."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"kind":"mentions","mentions":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/SavingAndLoadingWorlds"]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Discussion","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Use this method to place a saved group of entities into a world, as many times as you"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"like: a squad of enemies, a room of a level. Each live entity of the scene is spawned as a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"new entity with its components, hierarchy and relations. The scene’s resources replace"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"any of the same types the world holds."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A component that conforms to ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/MapEntities","isActive":true},{"text":", such as a relation’s ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Targets","isActive":true},{"text":", has each","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"of the scene’s entities it names replaced by the entity spawned for it. Entities outside","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the scene are left as they are. The following example spawns a squad twice, and each","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"copy’s follower follows its own copy’s leader:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["var registry = TypeRegistry()","try registry.register(Name.self, named: \"Name\")","try registry.register(Follows.self, named: \"Follows\")","","var squad = World()","let leader = squad.spawn(Name(value: \"Captain\"))","let follower = squad.spawn(Name(value: \"Private\"), Follows(leader: leader))","let saved = squad.scene(registry)","","var world = World()","let alpha = world.spawn(contentsOf: saved)","let bravo = world.spawn(contentsOf: saved)","print(world.count)","\/\/ Prints \"4\"","","let bravoFollower = bravo[follower]!","print(world[Follows.self, of: bravoFollower].leader == bravo[leader])","\/\/ Prints \"true\"","print(alpha[leader] == bravo[leader])","\/\/ Prints \"false\""]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Components are inserted as "},{"code":"insert(_:into:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" inserts them, running hooks."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"name":"Complexity","style":"note","type":"aside","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"O(","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"n","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":"), where ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"n"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" is the number of entities and components spawned.","type":"text"}]}]}]}],"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/spawn(contentsOf:)"},"metadata":{"title":"spawn(contentsOf:)","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"spawn","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"contentsOf","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule5SceneV","text":"Scene","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> [","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule6EntityV","text":"Entity","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule6EntityV","text":"Entity","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"]","kind":"text"}],"remoteSource":{"fileName":"Scene.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/ECS\/blob\/main\/Sources\/WorldModule\/Scene.swift#L894"},"roleHeading":"Instance Method","modules":[{"name":"WorldModule"}],"extendedModule":"WorldModule","symbolKind":"method","role":"symbol","externalID":"s:11WorldModule0A0V5spawn10contentsOfSDyAA6EntityVAGGAA5SceneV_tF"},"seeAlsoSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/snapshot(_:)","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/init(restoring:)-6alog","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/scene(_:)","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/init(restor